lacture 2 what is oop ?
what is oop ? 
oop stand for object oriented programming ,it is way of programming. which used class and object.

class --> * class is one type of user define dataType.
* class is blueprint to create object .class is collection of methods and attribbutes.
datatype -->type of data 
blueprint -->one type of structure of real object 
collection =-> group 
attributes --> variables declared in the class.
methods --> function declare in the class 
object -> object is an instance of the class . object is representative of the class .object is used to access methods and attributes declared in the class.
* we need to declare object to use class.
* object is one type of variable .




